# Enter the devShell automatically (sops, age, nixfmt, nh) and install the
# git pre-commit hooks via its shellHook.
#
# This also pins the devShell as a GC root under .direnv/, which matters:
# without it, `nix-collect-garbage` deletes the pre-commit package while
# .git/hooks/pre-commit still points at its store path, and every commit then
# fails with "No such file or directory". Run `direnv allow` once per clone.
use flake
